# Next.js

- App Router under `src/app/`; shared UI in `src/components/`
- Use `next/link` for internal routes
- Hosted on Vercel: no `basePath`, no static-export requirement
- Prefer server components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed
- Do not reintroduce GitHub Pages `output: 'export'` / `basePath` unless asked
